### Quick API walkthrough (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request" above each block)
@base = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Sign up (copy access_token into @token below)
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "password123", "shop_name": "Raj Jewellers", "phone": "9999900000" }

### 2. Log in
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "password123" }

@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Fetch today's rates (uses RATE_PROVIDER)
POST {{base}}/rates/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. See rates
GET {{base}}/rates/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Set your margin (2% + Rs 50/gram on gold)
PUT {{base}}/margins/gold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "margin_percent": 2, "making_per_gram": 50 }

### 6. Banner (open the response image)
GET {{base}}/banner.png
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Add customer
POST {{base}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sunita Devi", "phone": "9876543210" }

### 8. Alert rule: silver 3% below 30-day average, notify yourself
POST {{base}}/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Silver dip", "metal": "silver", "kind": "below_avg_pct", "window_days": 30, "threshold": 3, "audience": "self" }

### 9. Ask the AI (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
POST {{base}}/agent/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "aaj gold ka rate kya hai?" }] }
